   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Element Forge – App\n\nSwitch to **App mode** (top right): the bar on the left, the canvas in the middle. Step by step:\n\n1. **Clip** – your video in ComfyUI's `input` folder (a picture works too: drop it onto the canvas).\n2. **Effect** – choose what to add. Particle styles start a quick preview right away (no AI).\n3. **Canvas & Timeline** – the steps of the app: under *Position & Track* click where the effect sits and\n   *Check the track*; then *Effect*, *Scene & finish* and *Output*.\n4. **Settings from canvas** – turns the canvas into the settings of the one workflow.\n5. **Run** – press Run. When queued, this node becomes the full graph of the chosen style (app, climb or dissolve),\n   the same as the standalone app. The comp shows on it; passes (EXR) and the track check go to\n   `output/element-forge/<run>/`. Unchanged steps come from ComfyUI's cache.\n"
   ],
   "title": "How to use"
  },
